  "description": [
   {
    "value": "马克·吐温（Mark Twain），美国作家、演说家，真实姓名是萨缪尔·兰亨·克莱门（Samuel Langhorne Clemens）。“马克·吐温”是他的笔名，原是密西西比河水手使用的表示在航道上所测水的深度的术语。代表作品有小说《百万英镑》、《哈克贝利·费恩历险记》、《汤姆·索亚历险记》等。",
    "lang": "zh",
    "via": "llm:embedded_opengraph.json: $[0]['og:description'] (first sentences)",
    "file": "P6441.json",
    "uri": false
   },
   {
    "value": "Mark Twain, an American author and orator, whose real name was Samuel Langhorne Clemens, was a pseudonym. \"Mark Twain\" was originally a term used by Mississippi River sailors to indicate the depth of water measured in the channel. His representative works include the novels *The Million Pound Note*, *Adventures of Huckleberry Finn*, and *Adventures of Tom Sawyer*. Mark Twain wrote extensively throughout his life, covering novels, plays, essays, and poetry. In terms of content, his works criticiz",
    "lang": "en",
    "via": "llm-page:Character Profile",
    "file": "P6441.json",
    "uri": false
   }
  ],
